          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "一、含有 $x^n$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.079,
            0.287,
            0.399,
            0.366
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "1. $\\int x^{n}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{x^{n + 1}}{n + 1} +C,\\quad n\\neq -1$\n2. $\\int \\frac{1}{x} \\mathrm{d}x = \\ln |x| + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.034,
            0.379,
            0.285,
            0.398
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "二、含有 $a + bx$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.079,
            0.411,
            0.515,
            0.445
          ],
          "content": "3. $\\int \\frac{x}{a + bx}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{b^2} (bx - a\\ln |a + bx|) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.454,
            0.575,
            0.49
          ],
          "content": "4. $\\int \\frac{x}{(a + bx)^2} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{b^2} \\left( \\frac{a}{a + bx} + \\ln |a + bx| \\right) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.497,
            0.529,
            0.535
          ],
          "content": "5. $\\int \\frac{x}{(a + bx)^n} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{b^2} \\left[ \\frac{-1}{(n - 2)(a + bx)^{n-2}} + \\right.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.28,
            0.544,
            0.652,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": "\\left. \\frac {a}{(n - 1) (a + b x) ^ {n - 1}} \\right] + C, \\quad n \\neq 1, 2",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0257-0288/images/page_285_equation_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.583,
            0.648,
            0.62
          ],
          "content": "6. $\\int \\frac{x^2}{a + bx}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{b^3}\\left[-\\frac{bx}{2} (2a - bx) + a^2\\ln |a + bx|\\right] + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.625,
            0.65,
            0.664
          ],
          "content": "7. $\\int \\frac{x^2}{(a + bx)^2} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{b^3} \\left( bx - \\frac{a^2}{a + bx} - 2a \\ln |a + bx| \\right) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.669,
            0.717,
            0.709
          ],
          "content": "8. $\\int \\frac{x^2}{(a + bx)^3} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{b^3} \\left[ \\frac{2a}{a + bx} - \\frac{a^2}{2(a + bx)^2} + \\ln |a + bx| \\right] + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.714,
            0.527,
            0.752
          ],
          "content": "9. $\\int \\frac{x^2}{(a + bx)^n}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{b^3}\\left[\\frac{-1}{(n - 3)(a + bx)^{n - 3}} +\\right.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.274,
            0.757,
            0.89,
            0.796
          ],
          "content": "\\left. \\frac {2 a}{(n - 2) (a + b x) ^ {n - 2}} - \\frac {a ^ {2}}{(n - 1) (a + b x) ^ {n - 1}} \\right] + C, \\quad n \\neq 1, 2, 3",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0257-0288/images/page_285_equation_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.8,
            0.46,
            0.838
          ],
          "content": "10. $\\int \\frac{1}{x(a + bx)}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{a}\\ln \\left|\\frac{x}{a + bx}\\right| + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.842,
            0.612,
            0.881
          ],
          "content": "11. $\\int \\frac{1}{x(a + bx)^2} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{a} \\left( \\frac{1}{a + bx} + \\frac{1}{a} \\ln \\left| \\frac{x}{a + bx} \\right| \\right) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.085,
            0.886,
            0.589,
            0.924
          ],
          "content": "12. $\\int \\frac{1}{x^2(a + bx)}\\mathrm{d}x = -\\frac{1}{a}\\left(\\frac{1}{x} +\\frac{b}{a}\\ln \\left|\\frac{x}{a + bx}\\right|\\right) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.911,
            0.957,
            0.942,
            0.968
          ],
          "content": "275"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 286,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.104,
            0.025,
            0.281,
            0.041
          ],
          "content": "附录Ⅱ 积分表"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.073,
            0.748,
            0.113
          ],
          "content": "13. $\\int \\frac{1}{x^2(a + bx)^2}\\mathrm{d}x = -\\frac{1}{a^2}\\left[\\frac{a + 2bx}{x(a + bx)} +\\frac{2b}{a}\\ln \\left|\\frac{x}{a + bx}\\right|\\right] + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.103,
            0.123,
            0.421,
            0.144
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "三、含有 $a^2 \\pm x^2, a > 0$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.16,
            0.643,
            0.297
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "14. $\\int \\frac{1}{a^2 + x^2}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{a}\\arctan \\frac{x}{a} +C$\n15. $\\int \\frac{1}{x^2 - a^2}\\mathrm{d}x = -\\int \\frac{1}{a^2 - x^2}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2a}\\ln \\left|\\frac{x - a}{x + a}\\right| + C$\n16. $\\int \\frac{1}{(a^2\\pm x^2)^n}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2a^2(n - 1)}\\left[\\frac{x}{(a^2\\pm x^2)^{n - 1}} +\\right.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.361,
            0.308,
            0.732,
            0.345
          ],
          "content": "(2 n - 3) \\int \\frac {1}{(a ^ {2} \\pm x ^ {2}) ^ {n - 1}} \\mathrm{d} x \\Big ], \\quad n \\neq 1",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0257-0288/images/page_286_equation_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.105,
            0.362,
            0.502,
            0.382
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "四、含有 $a + bx + cx^2, b^2 \\neq 4ac$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.402,
            0.783,
            0.443
          ],
          "content": "17. $\\int \\frac{1}{a + bx + cx^2}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{4ac - b^2}}\\arctan \\frac{2cx + b}{\\sqrt{4ac - b^2}} +C,\\quad b^2 < 4ac$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.358,
            0.455,
            0.793,
            0.502
          ],
          "content": "= \\frac {1}{\\sqrt {b ^ {2} - 4 a c}} \\ln \\left| \\frac {2 c x + b - \\sqrt {b ^ {2} - 4 a c}}{2 c x + b + \\sqrt {b ^ {2} - 4 a c}} \\right| + C, \\quad b ^ {2} > 4 a c",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0257-0288/images/page_286_equation_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.516,
            0.793,
            0.554
          ],
          "content": "18. $\\int \\frac{x}{a + bx + cx^2}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2c}\\left(\\ln |a + bx + cx^2| - b\\int \\frac{1}{a + bx + cx^2}\\mathrm{d}x\\right)$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.573,
            0.367,
            0.593
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "五、含有 $\\sqrt{a + bx}$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.613,
            0.831,
            0.647
          ],
          "content": "19. $\\int x^{n}\\sqrt{a + bx}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{2}{b(2n + 3)}\\cdot \\left[x^{n}(a + bx)^{3 / 2} - na\\int x^{n - 1}\\sqrt{a + bx}\\mathrm{d}x\\right]$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.659,
            0.695,
            0.705
          ],
          "content": "20. $\\int \\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{a + bx}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a}}\\ln \\left|\\frac{\\sqrt{a + bx} - \\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{a + bx} + \\sqrt{a}}\\right| + C,\\quad a > 0$"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.334,
            0.719,
            0.699,
            0.761
          ],
          "content": "= \\frac {2}{\\sqrt {- a}} \\arctan \\sqrt {\\frac {a + b x}{- a}} + C, \\quad a <   0",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0257-0288/images/page_286_equation_15.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.773,
            0.926,
            0.919
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "21. $\\int \\frac{1}{x^n\\sqrt{a + bx}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{-1}{a(n - 1)}\\left[\\frac{\\sqrt{a + bx}}{x^{n - 1}} +\\frac{b(2n - 3)}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{x^{n - 1}\\sqrt{a + bx}}\\mathrm{d}x\\right],\\quad n\\neq 1$\n22. $\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{a + bx}}{x}\\mathrm{d}x = 2\\sqrt{a + bx} +a\\int \\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{a + bx}}\\mathrm{d}x$\n23. $\\int \\frac{\\sqrt{a + bx}}{x^n}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{-1}{a(n - 1)}\\left[\\frac{(a + bx)^{3 / 2}}{x^{n - 1}} +\\right.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.063,
            0.954,
            0.094,
            0.965
          ],
          "content": "276"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 287,
      "blocks": [
        {
