          ],
          "content": "11"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.298,
            0.083,
            0.636,
            0.121
          ],
          "content": "\\frac {(2 n - 5) b}{2} \\int \\frac {\\sqrt {a + b x}}{x ^ {n - 1}} \\mathrm{d} x \\Bigg ], \\quad n \\neq 1",
          "image_source": "../../raw/pages_0257-0288/images/page_287_equation_2.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.128,
            0.674,
            0.215
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "24. $\\int \\frac{x}{\\sqrt{a + bx}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{-2(2a - bx)}{3b^2}\\sqrt{a + bx} +C$\n25. $\\int \\frac{x^n}{\\sqrt{a + bx}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{2}{(2n + 1)b}\\left(x^n\\sqrt{a + bx} -na\\int \\frac{x^{n - 1}}{\\sqrt{a + bx}}\\mathrm{d}x\\right)$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.043,
            0.227,
            0.372,
            0.249
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "六、含有 $\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}$ ， $a > 0$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.258,
            0.753,
            0.758
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "26. $\\int \\sqrt{x^2 \\pm a^2} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(x\\sqrt{x^2 \\pm a^2} \\pm a^2 \\ln |x + \\sqrt{x^2 \\pm a^2} |\\right) + C$\n27. $\\int x^{2}\\sqrt{x^{2} \\pm a^{2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{8}\\left[x(2x^{2} \\pm a^{2})\\sqrt{x^{2} \\pm a^{2}} - a^{4}\\ln |x + \\sqrt{x^{2} \\pm a^{2}}|\\right] + C$\n28. $\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\sqrt{x^2 + a^2}\\mathrm{d}x = \\sqrt{x^2 + a^2} -a\\ln \\left|\\frac{a + \\sqrt{x^2 + a^2}}{x}\\right| + C$\n29. $\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\sqrt{x^2 - a^2}\\mathrm{d}x = \\sqrt{x^2 - a^2} -a\\arccos \\frac{a}{x} +C$\n30. $\\int \\frac{1}{x^2}\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{-1}{x}\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2} +\\ln |x + \\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}| + C$\n31. $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2 \\pm a^2}} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\ln |x + \\sqrt{x^2 \\pm a^2}| + C$\n32. $\\int \\frac{x^2}{\\sqrt{x^2 \\pm a^2}} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2} (x\\sqrt{x^2 \\pm a^2} + a^2 \\ln |x + \\sqrt{x^2 \\pm a^2}|) + C$\n33. $\\int \\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{x^2 - a^2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{a}\\arccos \\frac{a}{x} +C$\n34. $\\int \\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{x^2 + a^2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{-1}{a}\\ln \\left|\\frac{a + \\sqrt{x^2 + a^2}}{x}\\right| + C$\n35. $\\int \\frac{1}{x^2\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\mp \\frac{\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}}{a^2x} +C$\n36. $\\int \\frac{1}{(x^2\\pm a^2)^{3 / 2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{\\pm x}{a^2\\sqrt{x^2\\pm a^2}} +C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.043,
            0.77,
            0.377,
            0.792
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "七、含有 $\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}, a > 0$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.087,
            0.802,
            0.753,
            0.925
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "37. $\\int \\sqrt{a^2 - x^2} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2} \\left( x\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2} + a^2 \\arcsin \\frac{x}{a} \\right) + C$\n38. $\\int x^{2}\\sqrt{a^{2} - x^{2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{8}\\left[x(2x^{2} - a^{2})\\sqrt{a^{2} - x^{2}} +a^{4}\\arcsin \\frac{x}{a}\\right] + C$\n39. $\\int \\frac{1}{x}\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\sqrt{a^2 - x^2} - a\\ln \\left|\\frac{a + \\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}}{x}\\right| + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.921,
            0.958,
            0.951,
            0.969
          ],
          "content": "277"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 288,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.1,
            0.028,
            0.278,
            0.043
          ],
          "content": "附录Ⅱ 积分表"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.077,
            0.7,
            0.362
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "40. $\\int \\frac{1}{x^2}\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{-1}{x}\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2} -\\arcsin \\frac{x}{a} +C$\n41. $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\arcsin \\frac{x}{a} +C$\n42. $\\int \\frac{1}{x\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{-1}{a}\\ln \\left|\\frac{a + \\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}}{x}\\right| + C$\n43. $\\int \\frac{1}{x^2\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{-\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}}{a^2x} +C$\n44. $\\int \\frac{x^2}{\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2}\\left(-x\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2} +a^2\\arcsin \\frac{x}{a}\\right) + C$\n45. $\\int \\frac{1}{(a^2 - x^2)^{3 / 2}}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{x}{a^2\\sqrt{a^2 - x^2}} +C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.101,
            0.374,
            0.447,
            0.394
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "八、含有 $\\sin x$ 或 $\\cos x$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.407,
            0.69,
            0.921
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "46. $\\int \\sin x\\mathrm{d}x = -\\cos x + C$\n47. $\\int \\cos x\\mathrm{d}x = \\sin x + C$\n48. $\\int \\sin^2 x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2} (x - \\sin x\\cos x) + C$\n49. $\\int \\cos^2 x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2} (x + \\sin x\\cos x) + C$\n50. $\\int \\sin^n x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{n}\\left[-\\sin^{n - 1}x\\cos x + (n - 1)\\int \\sin^{n - 2}x\\mathrm{d}x\\right]$\n51. $\\int \\cos^n x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{n}\\left[\\cos^{n - 1}x\\sin x + (n - 1)\\int \\cos^{n - 2}x\\mathrm{d}x\\right]$\n52. $\\int x\\sin x\\mathrm{d}x = \\sin x - x\\cos x + C$\n53. $\\int x\\cos x\\mathrm{d}x = \\cos x + x\\sin x + C$\n54. $\\int x^{n}\\sin x\\mathrm{d}x = -x^{n}\\cos x + n\\int x^{n - 1}\\cos x\\mathrm{d}x$\n55. $\\int x^{n}\\cos x\\mathrm{d}x = x^{n}\\sin x - n\\int x^{n - 1}\\sin x\\mathrm{d}x$\n56. $\\int \\frac{1}{1 \\pm \\sin x} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\tan x \\mp \\sec x + C$\n57. $\\int \\frac{1}{1\\pm\\cos x}\\mathrm{d}x = -\\cot x\\pm \\csc x + C$\n58. $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sin x\\cos x}\\mathrm{d}x = \\ln |\\tan x| + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.06,
            0.956,
            0.091,
            0.967
          ],
          "content": "278"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 289,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.718,
            0.033,
            0.896,
