          ],
          "content": "附录Ⅱ 积分表"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.035,
            0.089,
            0.49,
            0.107
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "九、含有 $\\tan x, \\cot x, \\sec x, \\csc x$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.079,
            0.12,
            0.459,
            0.737
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "59. $\\int \\tan x\\mathrm{d}x = -\\ln |\\cos x| + C$\n60. $\\int \\cot x\\mathrm{d}x = \\ln |\\sin x| + C$\n61. $\\int \\sec x\\mathrm{d}x = \\ln |\\sec x + \\tan x| + C$\n62. $\\int \\csc x\\mathrm{d}x = \\ln |\\csc x - \\cot x| + C$\n63. $\\int \\tan^2 x\\mathrm{d}x = -x + \\tan x + C$\n64. $\\int \\cot^2 x\\mathrm{d}x = -x - \\cot x + C$\n65. $\\int \\sec^2 x\\mathrm{d}x = \\tan x + C$\n66. $\\int \\csc^2 x\\mathrm{d}x = -\\cot x + C$\n67. $\\int \\tan^n x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{\\tan^{n - 1}x}{n - 1} -\\int \\tan^{n - 2}x\\mathrm{d}x,\\quad n\\neq 1$\n68. $\\int \\cot^n x\\mathrm{d}x = -\\frac{\\cot^{n - 1}x}{n - 1} -\\int \\cot^{n - 2}x\\mathrm{d}x,\\quad n\\neq 1$\n73. $\\int \\frac{1}{1 \\pm \\sec x} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = x + \\cot x \\mp \\csc x + C$\n74. $\\int \\frac{1}{1 \\pm \\csc x} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = x - \\tan x \\pm \\sec x + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.491,
            0.629,
            0.526
          ],
          "content": "69. $\\int \\sec^n x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{\\sec^{n - 2}x\\tan x}{n - 1} +\\frac{n - 2}{n - 1}\\int \\sec^{n - 2}x\\mathrm{d}x,\\quad n\\neq 1$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.533,
            0.645,
            0.568
          ],
          "content": "70. $\\int \\csc^n x\\mathrm{d}x = -\\frac{\\csc^{n - 2}x\\cot x}{n - 1} +\\frac{n - 2}{n - 1}\\int \\csc^{n - 2}x\\mathrm{d}x,\\quad n\\neq 1$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.576,
            0.596,
            0.609
          ],
          "content": "71. $\\int \\frac{1}{1 \\pm \\tan x} \\, \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2} (x \\pm \\ln |\\cos x \\pm \\sin x|) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.617,
            0.601,
            0.652
          ],
          "content": "72. $\\int \\frac{1}{1 \\pm \\cot x} \\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2} (x \\mp \\ln |\\sin x \\pm \\cos x|) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.038,
            0.748,
            0.357,
            0.766
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "十、含有反三角函数的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.081,
            0.78,
            0.56,
            0.926
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "75. $\\int \\arcsin x\\mathrm{d}x = x\\arcsin x + \\sqrt{1 - x^2} +C$\n76. $\\int \\arccos x\\mathrm{d}x = x\\arccos x - \\sqrt{1 - x^2} +C$\n77. $\\int \\arctan x\\mathrm{d}x = x\\arctan x - \\frac{1}{2}\\ln (1 + x^2) + C$\n78. $\\int \\operatorname{arccot} x \\, \\mathrm{d}x = x \\operatorname{arccot} x + \\frac{1}{2} \\ln (1 + x^2) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.918,
            0.959,
            0.949,
            0.97
          ],
          "content": "279"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 290,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.106,
            0.031,
            0.284,
            0.047
          ],
          "content": "附录Ⅱ 积分表"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.081,
            0.768,
            0.318
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "79. $\\int \\operatorname{arcsec} x \\, \\mathrm{d}x = x \\operatorname{arcsec} x - \\ln |x + \\sqrt{x^2 - 1}| + C$\n80. $\\int \\operatorname{arccsc} x \\, \\mathrm{d}x = x \\operatorname{arccsc} x + \\ln |x + \\sqrt{x^2 - 1}| + C$\n81. $\\int x\\arcsin x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{4}\\left[x\\sqrt{1 - x^2} +(2x^2 -1)\\arcsin x\\right] + C$\n82. $\\int x\\arccos x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{4}\\left[-x\\sqrt{1 - x^2} + (2x^2 - 1)\\arccos x\\right] + C$\n83. $\\int x\\arctan x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2}\\left[(1 + x^2)\\arctan x - x\\right] + C$\n84. $\\int x\\operatorname{arccot}x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{1}{2}\\left[(1 + x^2)\\operatorname{arccot}x + x\\right] + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.107,
            0.332,
            0.354,
            0.352
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "十一、含有 $\\mathrm{e}^x$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.363,
            0.361,
            0.398
          ],
          "content": "85. $\\int a^{x}\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{a^{x}}{\\ln a} +C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.409,
            0.34,
            0.436
          ],
          "content": "86. $\\int \\mathrm{e}^{x}\\mathrm{d}x = \\mathrm{e}^{x} + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.446,
            0.43,
            0.473
          ],
          "content": "87. $\\int x\\mathrm{e}^{x}\\mathrm{d}x = (x - 1)\\mathrm{e}^{x} + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.483,
            0.467,
            0.511
          ],
          "content": "88. $\\int x^{n}\\mathrm{e}^{x}\\mathrm{d}x = x^{n}\\mathrm{e}^{x} - n\\int x^{n - 1}\\mathrm{e}^{x}\\mathrm{d}x$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.519,
            0.512,
            0.553
          ],
          "content": "89. $\\int \\frac{1}{1 + \\mathrm{e}^x}\\mathrm{d}x = x - \\ln (1 + \\mathrm{e}^x) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.562,
            0.651,
            0.597
          ],
          "content": "90. $\\int \\mathrm{e}^{ax}\\sin bx\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{\\mathrm{e}^{ax}}{a^2 + b^2} (a\\sin bx - b\\cos bx) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.606,
            0.653,
            0.641
          ],
          "content": "91. $\\int \\mathrm{e}^{ax}\\cos bx\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{\\mathrm{e}^{ax}}{a^2 + b^2}(a\\cos bx + b\\sin bx) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.655,
            0.375,
            0.674
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "十二、含有 $\\ln x$ 的形式"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.688,
            0.457,
            0.716
          ],
          "content": "92. $\\int \\ln x\\mathrm{d}x = x(\\ln x - 1) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.724,
            0.499,
            0.763
          ],
          "content": "93. $\\int \\frac{\\ln x}{\\sqrt{x}}\\mathrm{d}x = 4\\sqrt{x} (\\ln \\sqrt{x} -1) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.769,
            0.49,
            0.803
          ],
          "content": "94. $\\int x\\ln x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{x^2}{4} (2\\ln x - 1) + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.811,
            0.746,
            0.85
          ],
          "content": "95. $\\int x^{n}\\ln x\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{x^{n + 1}}{(n + 1)^{2}} [(n + 1)\\ln x - 1] + C, n\\neq -1$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.859,
            0.607,
            0.887
          ],
          "content": "96. $\\int (\\ln x)^2\\mathrm{d}x = x[(\\ln x)^2 - 2\\ln x + 2] + C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.896,
            0.582,
            0.924
          ],
          "content": "97. $\\int (\\ln x)^n\\mathrm{d}x = x(\\ln x)^n -n\\int (\\ln x)^{n - 1}\\mathrm{d}x$"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.064,
            0.958,
            0.095,
            0.969
          ],
          "content": "280"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 291,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "bbox": [
            0.71,
            0.033,
            0.853,
            0.048
          ],
          "content": "附录Ⅱ 积分表"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.073,
            0.086,
            0.695,
            0.197
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "98. $\\int \\sin (\\ln x)\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{x}{2}\\left[\\sin (\\ln x) - \\cos (\\ln x)\\right] + C$\n99. $\\int \\cos (\\ln x)\\mathrm{d}x = \\frac{x}{2} [\\sin (\\ln x) + \\cos (\\ln x)] + C$\n100. $\\int \\ln (x + \\sqrt{1 + x^2})\\mathrm{d}x = x\\ln (x + \\sqrt{1 + x^2}) - \\sqrt{1 + x^2} +C$"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
